    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Security.ConfidentialLedger_2.0.0-beta.3"&gt;Azure.Security.ConfidentialLedger_2.0.0-beta.3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;2.0.0-beta.3 (2026-08-17)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed &lt;code&gt;ConfidentialLedgerClientOptions.EnableArchivedCollectionFallback&lt;/code&gt; to default to &lt;code&gt;false&lt;/code&gt;. Callers that require &lt;code&gt;GetCurrentLedgerEntry&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;GetCurrentLedgerEntryAsync&lt;/code&gt; to search ledger history after a collection-specific 404 must now explicitly opt in by setting the option to &lt;code&gt;true&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning.ServiceBus_1.2.0-beta.1"&gt;Azure.Provisioning.ServiceBus_1.2.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.2.0-beta.1 (2026-08-19)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Migrated the library to TypeSpec generation and updated the Service Bus API version to &lt;code&gt;2026-01-01&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning.CognitiveServices_1.3.0-beta.1"&gt;Azure.Provisioning.CognitiveServices_1.3.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.3.0-beta.1 (2026-08-18)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regenerated with the TypeSpec-based provisioning generator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated default API version to &lt;code&gt;2026-05-01&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
